  "question": {
    "text": "In a binary compound, atoms of element <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> form a hcp structure and those of element <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>&nbsp;occupy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;of the tetrahedral voids of the hcp structure. The formula of the binary compound is:"
